{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "diagram_type": "lifecycle",
  "meta": {
    "title": "一次 run 的生命周期:审批、state 持久化与 once 都以执行结果为准",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "animation": "trace",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "viewBox": [
      980,
      660
    ],
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "ok",
        "label": "① 正常",
        "focus": [
          "queued",
          "running",
          "ok"
        ],
        "note": "成功 → 返回的 state 才持久化、notify 才投递、once:true 才停用 job。「判定到了」和「做成了」由这一步分开。"
      },
      {
        "id": "approve",
        "label": "② 审批(agentTurn 才有)",
        "focus": [
          "running",
          "waiting",
          "grant"
        ],
        "note": "高危动作 → approval card 送到审批面,run 等待;Always allow 铸一枚 standing grant,以后同类不再问。script payload 没有这条路。"
      },
      {
        "id": "fail",
        "label": "③ 失败 / 跳过",
        "focus": [
          "running",
          "waiting",
          "error",
          "skipped"
        ],
        "note": "抛错 / 超时 / 拒绝 → error:state 不持久化、退避、failureAlert;once 不生效,下次条件仍成立可再 fire。重复 / 过期 / 预检失败 → skipped。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "main",
      "label": "run"
    },
    {
      "id": "approval",
      "label": "审批(官方)"
